    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="17.1">
        <head>Cn 1018 17.1</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#kennedy" n="17.1" corresp="#wit-d">7 gearwige eac to huselgange. huru þriwa on geare. gehwa hine silfne. þe his agene þearfe understandan cunne swa swa him þearf sy</ab>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="ang" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And gearwige eac to huselgange huru þriwa on geare gehwa hine silfne þe his agene þearfe understandan cunne swa swa him þearf sy.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#kennedy" corresp="#wit-d">And whoever is able to understand his own need as he ought should also prepare himself for the sacrament at least three times in the year.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#rabin-doml" corresp="#wit-d">And anyone who wishes to understand his own obligations must prepare himself to receive the sacrament at least three times during the year, just as is required of him.</ab>
      </div>
